{"data":{"body":"[P2] Assert that a non-finite deadline does not create a timer\n\nThis assertion does not protect the new `Number.isFinite` guard. `getRemainingTimeMs()` converts this fixture's `NaN` to `Infinity`; removing the guard repeatedly schedules overflow timeouts because `Infinity > 0`, while the handler can still return the asserted `SUCCEEDED` response. The test misses the resulting 1 ms timer/warning loop. Assert that no deadline timer is scheduled, so removing the guard fails the test as required by CONTRIBUTING rule 4.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs8AAAABDWM6ZA","finding_digest":"45895f7355cc1c7bbcd7cb1221e9bb47f82a27adbddd8bcb4539ea441b09d34d","finding_id":"arf_v1_iwev642vzqohxpgxzmjcd2n3i7","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js/src/with-durable-execution.deadline.composed.test.ts::no-finite-remaining-time::no-deadline-timer-coverage","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js/src/with-durable-execution.deadline.composed.test.ts::no-finite-remaining-time::no-deadline-timer-coverage","line":169,"observation_digest":"d69e9b3b2411a2fece2c4b25e08dc04f4bf8efc0628091b1bb2c72c2c58eb377","observation_id":"aro_v1_22pjwozecgrp5trmjms6bdoaj5","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js/src/with-durable-execution.deadline.composed.test.ts","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_iwev642vzqohxpgxzmjcd2n3i7","published_at":"2026-11-10T00:17:46Z","review_id":"arr_v1_sajceyzihphknqj3byfmsv6p4u","reviewed_base_sha":"d80f532428c15b451052841e5e6848d8f821d351","reviewed_head_sha":"40d39f3be6836e766bf14711357eaf8653ac7826","reviewer":"codex","start_line":166,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":1202},"record_id":"art_v1_7you4t3djwpqcqvq6ir6k6padt","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-11-10T00:17:46Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
